---
import {ChevronLeft, ChevronRight} from '@lucide/astro';
---
<aside class="desk-calendar" aria-label="文章日历">
  <span class="calendar-kicker"><i aria-hidden="true"></i> 记录日历 / CALENDAR</span>
  <div class="calendar-header"><h2 data-calendar-month>日历</h2><div><button type="button" data-calendar-shift="-1" aria-label="上一个月"><ChevronLeft size={17} stroke-width={1.4} aria-hidden="true"/></button><button type="button" data-calendar-shift="1" aria-label="下一个月"><ChevronRight size={17} stroke-width={1.4} aria-hidden="true"/></button></div></div>
  <div class="calendar-weekdays" aria-hidden="true">{['一','二','三','四','五','六','日'].map(day=><span>{day}</span>)}</div>
  <div class="calendar-grid" data-calendar-grid aria-label="日期"></div><noscript><p>开启 JavaScript 后，可以按日期翻阅文章。</p></noscript>
  <div class="calendar-legend"><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> 写下文章的日子</span><button type="button" data-calendar-today>今天</button></div>
  <div class="calendar-entry"><h3 data-calendar-selected>选择一天</h3><div data-calendar-entries aria-live="polite"></div></div>
  <span class="calendar-footnote">日历翻过去，窗外仍是今天。</span>
</aside>
